+## Built State
+- **Job.project_id** (`str | None = None`): additive field on the Job
+  model. `None` = legacy (pre-F148 jobs). No migration — old JSON loads
+  with `project_id=None` by default.
+- **Creation guard**: CLI entry points (`_cmd_create_job`, `_cmd_do`)
+  require `select_project` resolution; exit 3 with hint on failure.
+  Library funcs (`run_do`, `run_autorun`) keep permissive optional params.
+- **project_scope.py** (`packages/orchestration/`): `resolve_scope`
+  (flag/env/cwd precedence), `job_in_scope` (predicate with precomputed
+  legacy visibility), `scoped_jobs` (single listing helper — every scoped
+  command calls it). Legacy rule: `project_id=None` jobs visible only
+  under `--all-projects` or when exactly one project exists.
+- **Scoped commands**: `job list`, `status`, `stats failures` — all take
+  `--project` and `--all-projects` via shared catalog fragments.
+- **project adopt `<job_id>`**: per-job, positional, with 8-char short-ID
+  resolution. Rejects already-scoped jobs (exit 2).
+- **Display labels**: `(unscoped)` for `project_id=None` wherever listed;
+  `(orphaned: <8 chars>)` for deleted projects; `(project: <8 chars>)`
+  under `--all-projects` for cross-project jobs. Known-project-id set
+  built once per listing.
+- **Tests**: `test_project_scope.py` 13 unit tests,
+  `test_scoped_listings.py` 18 tests (8 CLI subprocess + 10 unit),
+  `test_storage.py` +2 backward-compat tests, `test_do_runtime.py` 14
+  tests updated with fixture project registration.
+- **Storage layout**: untouched. No directory moves, no file renames.
